027 obligations", "ABDM integration lab results", "ABHA health records", "diagnostics data platform India", "OMOP India", "LOINC mapping", "fractional CTO India", "healthcare data architecture India"], "faq": [["When do the DPDP Rules apply?", "In phases. The Rules were notified in November 2025. The consent manager framework applies from 13 November 2026, and most obligations on data fiduciaries, including notices, consent, rights, breach reporting and children's data, from 13 May 2027, according to published timelines."], ["How does ABDM fit with DPDP consent?", "ABDM has its own consent flow for sharing health records between providers through a patient's health account. A provider integrating with ABDM still has its own DPDP duties for the data it holds, so both need to be designed together."], ["Can a diagnostics company use patient data for research?", "Only on a sound legal basis and with appropriate safeguards. In this design, research uses pseudonymised data in a separate store, with purposes recorded and consent captured where it is the basis."]], "related": ["/fractional-cto-india/", "/healthcare-data-architecture/", "/ai-architect/"], "citations": [{"title": "Digital Personal Data Protection Rules, 2025", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Digital_Personal_Data_Protection_Rules,_2025", "publisher": "Wikipedia", "date": "2026"}, {"title": "DPDP Act Timeline 2026-27: What's Live, What's Coming", "url": "https://www.networkintelligence.ai/blogs/dpdp-act-compliance-timeline-2026-2027/", "publisher": "Network Intelligence", "date": "2026"}, {"title": "DPDP Act 2023 and Rules 2025: Phased Implementation Timeline and Business Compliance Deadlines", "url": "https://www.sansalegal.com/post/dpdp-act-2023-and-rules-2025-phased-implementation-timeline-and-business-compliance-deadlines", "publisher": "Sansa Legal", "date": "2026"}, {"title": "Ayushman Bharat Digital Mission", "url": "https://abdm.gov.in/", "publisher": "National Health Authority (India)"}, {"title